    "text": "UDP Operation Connectionless Services: > Each user datagram sent by UDP 1s an independent datagram. > The user datagrams are not numbered. > No connection establishment and no connection termination. > Process that uses UDP cannot send a stream of data to UDP and expect UDP to chop them into different related user datagrams. Only those processes sending short messages should use UDP. Flow and Error Control: > UDP 1s asimple, unreliable transport protocol. > No flow control and no window mechanism. > No error control mechanism in UDP except for the checksum. > When receiver detects an error through checksum, user datagram 1s silently discarded.",
